<title>JAPAN: Okinawa Cellular falls on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Okinawa Cellular falls on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Okinawa Cellular Telephone Co fell in over-the-counter trade on Thursday as investors moved to take profits.</p>
<p>The shares, which debuted on Tuesday, stood at 1.71 million yen at 0047 GMT, down from 1.91 million at the close on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
